<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Brood Mother</ansi> mutation

You have become a wellspring of life, endlessly birthing and
sustaining a brood.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Transformation (apex)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Apex
<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi> Sustaining Presence and Hive Mind

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  The conviction to sustain your companions eases to almost nothing,
  you can hold a whole swarm at once, and if you are ever left with
  no companion at all, your body simply births another -- you are
  never without your brood

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
